# A shell script with carriage returns at the ends of its lines dies on its first line on Linux, with
# a message about an invalid option name that says nothing about line endings. That cost an hour on a
# rented machine, and the same class of fault broke CI in another project in this portfolio.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webm binary
*.laz binary
*.bin binary
